  "title": "Jefferson Davis Pie",
  "description": "Jeff Davis pie is easy to make. This is a fabulously rich pecan pie without the pecans, and the topping is an incredible whipped bourbon cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Susan Hissam"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-02T15:09:43-04:00",
